<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Wednesday, July 16  used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Wednesday	July 16 $81.70   up 0.23</p>
<p>Tuesday	  July 15 $81.47   up 0.03</p>
<p>Monday	   July 14 $81.44   up 0.37</p>
